    "unique_elements": {
      "nonstandard_elements": "She reports being urged by a sensed presence to remove the mask; then experiencing a shift from observing herself to being 'inside the girl' and exerting effort to move her/right arm, followed by physical removal of the mask and an authoritative confrontation with the dentist. Long-term sense of a 'guardian' presence (including feeling a hand on her shoulder) is also reported.",
